镜头。第一帧起，<Picture 1> 陈落坐在 <Picture 3> 书桌前的办公椅上，面向屏幕方向，<Picture 2> 笔记本电脑在书桌中央亮着冷白光。0 到 3 秒，他抬起右手在键盘上轻轻敲击，目光专注。3 到 7 秒，他停下来，转头望向左侧大窗，窗外雨夜霓虹在玻璃上流动，窗帘被风掀起一角，台灯光在他脸上投下柔和阴影。7 到 10 秒，他重新低头看向屏幕继续打字。镜头为锁定的三脚架平视机位，仅轻微缓慢推近，全程垂直稳定，地平线水平、墙面竖线竖直，不摇镜不倾斜。保持 <Picture 1> 的身份服装，<Picture 2> 的机身形态与屏幕冷白光，<Picture 3> 的房间布局与陈设位置完全一致。连续单一镜头，无剪切、无跳变、无穿模、无多余人物、无第二台电脑、无物品变形。\n\noverall_soundscape: 窗外持续雨声敲打玻璃，深夜房间低频嗡鸣，键盘敲击声，台灯电流声，偶尔书页翻动声；无对白。\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A","宽度":832,"高度":480,"视频帧率":24,"视频秒数":10}}}]},{"id":5,"type":"CLIPLoader","pos":[1150,0],"size":[270,150],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"CLIP名称","name":"clip_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clip_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"类型","name":"type","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"type"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"设备","name":"device","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"device"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","slot_index":0,"links":[8]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPLoader","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"clip_name":true,"type":true,"device":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors","minimax","default"]},{"id":4,"type":"UNETLoader","pos":[1150,200],"size":[270,120],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"UNet名称","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"数据类型","name":"weight_dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"weight_dtype"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","slot_index":0,"links":[1]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"UNETLoader","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"unet_name":true,"weight_dtype":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors","default"]},{"id":2,"type":"VAELoader","pos":[1150,370],"size":[270,90],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"